  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a National Slum Upgrading Strategy for the Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to develop a National Slum Upgrading Strategy (NSUS) to guide the National Government and local government units in the preparation and implementation of effective policies and programs on slum upgrading.  The NSUS will help improve the poor condition of slum communities and address their impact on the larger society and the economy.</narrative>
  </description>
